### Get FCD data for list 
GET https://localhost:8443/api/fcd?listId=5837&country=Argentina&countryGadm=ARG&category=WDPA,landmark,country,classified_region
Content-Type: application/zip
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Get FCD data for list filtered by locationId
GET https://localhost:8443/api/fcd?listId=5837&country=Argentina&countryGadm=ARG&locationId=7&category=WDPA,landmark,country,classified_region
Content-Type: application/zip
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}
